  "Wie viel Schaden macht dein Champion mit welchen Items? DPS-Rechner für TFT Set {0}: bis zu vier Item-Builds über {1} Sekunden im Graph vergleichen.": "How much damage does your champion deal with which items? DPS Calculator for TFT Set {0}: compare up to four item builds over {1} seconds in a graph.",
